; atc_return.ngc - Return the current tool to its carousel pocket
;
; Called by flexihal_atc.c tool_change() when the requested tool is NOT
; in the carousel but the outgoing tool IS.  Named parameter set by plugin:
;
;   #<_atc_outgoing_pocket>  = carousel pocket to return the tool to
;
; atc_pause.ngc runs immediately after this macro to handle the manual swap.
; No $TCMEASURE here — that is handled by atc_pause.ngc.

M5    ; ensure spindle is off
M9    ; ensure coolant is off

; ── Calculate return pocket XY ───────────────────────────────────────────────
; Must match the geometry in atc_change.ngc
#100 = [50.0 + [#<_atc_outgoing_pocket> - 1] * 40.0]   ; pocket X
#101 = 200.0                                              ; pocket Y

; ── Retract to safe Z ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
G53 G0 Z#<_home_z>

; ── Move to return pocket and release tool ────────────────────────────────────
G53 G0 X#100 Y#101
G53 G0 Z#<_atc_z_start>
G53 G1 Z#<_atc_z_engage> F#<_atc_feed>
$DRBO
G4 P0.5
G53 G0 Z#<_home_z>

M2
